[{"client_msg_id":"4F2A9278-7B83-42F0-8995-0EF7FD7E63CA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"knexは生のSQLも書けますし","ts":"1636726006.398500","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1636732933.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fwA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7D88CD70-89A5-40D4-932D-F086A55854D7","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"こういうツールを使うメリットって、どちらかというと実行管理の方が強いと思います。","ts":"1636725968.397800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":1,"users":["U0177HB2VA8"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+k4D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"859098a0-59b8-4a59-9e71-d621460c3132","type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"ありがとうございます。\ntypeormが良いかどうかはおいておいて、若い同僚が\n`cliのgenerateでちゃんと生成できないんだったらentity書くのめんどくさいし、mysqlとか薄いライブラリでSQL書いていくほうが楽でいいんですけど。`\nという議論になって、「そもそもみんなはどうやって書いてるんだろう？」と思った次第でした。\n※ DBはMariaDBを使っています。\n\nマイグレーションフィアルの自動生成は初回だけにとどめておくようにしたいと思います。","ts":"1636725614.396900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2K1o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DBB897DC-A348-42F7-AF79-FB1B90A94ECA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"その使い方ですね。コードはもちろん自分で書きますが、up/downで一応管理されるのと、クエリビルダーなのでその時の使い方で表現できないクエリはなかったって感じですね。","ts":"1636724423.390800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ijz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba1c2361-5a2c-4602-8762-d8d28cfe395f","type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"DBアクセス部分がtypeormで、マイグレーションはknexを使っていたということでしょうか？\nknexも自分でマイグレーションのコードを書く感じかと思うので、やっぱり主流は自分で書いていく感じですかね。。。","ts":"1636722690.388600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z84N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FEBA7009-BACC-4650-8836-86CF0974D734","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"数年後に Typeorm使ったときはマイグレーションはKnexで実行していました。\n\u003chttp://knexjs.org/|http://knexjs.org/\u003e","ts":"1636721649.386800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZGef"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ac33b0b-49c3-4f05-a9f1-5166c409fa32","type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"\u003c#C012HHBHWUR|tech-db\u003e 案件かもしれないのですが、typeorm 使っている方っていらっしゃいますか？\nもしいましたらmigration ファイルってどうやって使っていますか？\ntypeormのcliでマイグレーションファイルをgenerateすると、変更していないentityとか、カラム名の変更がdrop → add になったりとあまり信頼できそうな感じがしていません。\nentityの変更は怪しいので、自分で書いていくのが主流だったりするのでしょうか？","ts":"1636718912.385700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NQLsl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85342f54-9303-44e9-a656-b0709c748774","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"こちらも学びがあった","ts":"1636645287.382700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tUx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73ddf5a2-558c-4590-a084-137167bf3f76","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003c@U9S4G0LJW\u003e ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m","ts":"1636645275.382400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6ydUn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b7b6048-8e6c-44dd-b3a6-4e5e8a116cc1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ひとまずborder出たので良しとしよ","ts":"1636645270.382200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lbD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"618b40e6-eeef-4f7a-970e-8cce3efbabaf","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ですよね","ts":"1636645252.381900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4X1c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bec2bc16-29ef-4fb8-a8ef-331f29d6f47e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"カラースキームというのがVim全体でグローバルなのでそのへんはしょうがないかなーと","ts":"1636645144.381700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_origin